{
  "title": "spectrl: URL-safe interchange for mass spectra",
  "description": "spectrl encodes mass-spectrum peak arrays, modeled metadata, and precursor information in a URL-safe token. The token can be shared in URLs, QR codes, notebooks, and publications without a backend repository. Metadata uses mzML controlled-vocabulary semantics and may include a ProForma interpretation.",
